      "text": "People who remember the arrangement"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Went looking for people who remember the original arrangement. Three of them do. Two want money and one wants my uncle embarrassed, which is cheaper.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "Three people remember the arrangement. Two of them would like to be paid to; the third would like not to be asked.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "face",
      "actor": "fang-qiu-wife",
      "target": "fang-yuan"
    },
    {
      "op": "gesture",
