      "gesture": "talk-point"
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 106,
      "text": "Chapter 106"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Paid the two. Recorded the amount, because the point of this ledger is that I never pretend a victory was free.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 107,
      "text": "Chapter 107"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "My aunt came to the tavern to explain to the room that I was ungrateful. She is effective at this. I let her finish and then asked her, quietly, which year the transfer was recorded in.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 108,
      "text": "Chapter 108"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "She did not know. Neither does he. A household that cannot date its own paperwork loses to a household that can.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
